  m_text: 'Some enemies have resistance icons above them.

    Armor: Cannon damage
    is reduced by 25%.

    Magic: Magic damage is reduced by 40%.

    Slow: Slow
    effects are reduced by 50%.

    Poison: Poison damage is reduced by 60%.

    Stun:
    Stun effects are blocked.

'
